<Slide style={{ width: '1280px', height: '720px', background: '#0B1220', padding: '20px 64px' }}>
  <Box style={{ height: 100, borderLeft: '6px solid #38BDF8', paddingLeft: 18, justifyContent: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E5EDF7' }}>当前工程团队的五大挑战</Text>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 540, flexDirection: 'row', gap: 32 }}>
    <Box style={{ width: '30%', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
      <Box>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 96, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#EF4444', lineHeight: 1 }}>5</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, color: '#E5EDF7', marginTop: 6 }}>大真实痛点</Text>
      </Box>
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.6 }}>注：原演讲编号从"一/二"跳到"五"，第 3、4 项在转录中缺失，本页据上下文补全归类。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ width: '70%', gap: 12, justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 40, height: 40, borderRadius: 8, background: '#16203A', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#38BDF8' }}>1</Text></Box>
        <Box><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E5EDF7' }}>重复性手工工作</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>调试循环：查报告、翻 trace、处理报文阻塞、全部重跑；用例编写与总线仿真全靠点击。</Text></Box>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 40, height: 40, borderRadius: 8, background: '#16203A', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#38BDF8' }}>2</Text></Box>
        <Box><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E5EDF7' }}>依赖大量专业知识</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>要懂总线系统与协议，还要会写代码、做配置，门槛高。</Text></Box>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 40, height: 40, borderRadius: 8, background: '#16203A', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#38BDF8' }}>3</Text></Box>
        <Box><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E5EDF7' }}>找对文档耗时</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>定位正确的工程文档本身就要花大量时间。</Text></Box>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 40, height: 40, borderRadius: 8, background: '#16203A', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#38BDF8' }}>4</Text></Box>
        <Box><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E5EDF7' }}>上下文喂给 AI 成本高</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>AI 看不到你的配置/数据库；直接喂大上下文因 token 成本而昂贵。</Text></Box>
      </Box>
      <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 14, alignItems: 'flex-start' }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 40, height: 40, borderRadius: 8, background: '#16203A', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'center' }}><Text style={{ fontSize: 20, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#38BDF8' }}>5</Text></Box>
        <Box><Text style={{ fontSize: 21, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E5EDF7' }}>答案缺乏依据（ungrounded）</Text><Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#94A3B8', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>通用 LLM 给不出针对汽车领域、更别说你当前工程的具体答案。</Text></Box>
      </Box>
    </Box>
  </Box>
  <Box style={{ height: 40, flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8' }}>Vector CANoe AI · 研讨会分享</Text>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#94A3B8' }}>05 / 23</Text>
  </Box>
</Slide>
